I am standing at the bus stop.
People are waiting for the bus.
The morning wind blows.
A green city bus is coming.
The bus stops in front of me.
I am getting into the bus quickly.
The bus is very crowded.
I do not get a seat.
I am standing in the middle of the bus.
I hold the overhead rail tightly.
The bus is running quickly.
There is heavy traffic on the Kochi road.
Cars and bikes are going quickly.
The conductor is giving tickets.
I take money from the bag.
I am giving money to the conductor.
I buy the ticket.
I am looking at the shops outside.
I am going to the office.
